  "applicationText": {
    "title": "朝の公園",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l27-app-block-001",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "（到分公司后）",
        "translationZh": "（到分公司后）",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（到分公司后）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l27-app-block-002",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-001",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "今朝、公園を散歩している時、大勢の人が集まっているのを見ました。",
            "translationZh": "今天早晨散步时，我看见许多人聚在公园里。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：今朝、公園を散歩している時、大勢の人が集まっているのを見ました。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-002-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 14.38,
              "duration": 14.38,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ああ、お年寄りが多かったでしょう？",
            "translationZh": "啊，老年人很多吧？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ああ、お年寄りが多かったでしょう？",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-002-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.7,
              "duration": 2.7,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-003",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "ええ。太極拳やラジオ体操をしていました。",
            "translationZh": "是的。他们在打太极拳、做广播体操。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：ええ。太極拳やラジオ体操をしていました。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-002-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.62,
              "duration": 3.62,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-004",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "朝の運動ですよ。社交ダンスをしている人たちもいたでしょう？",
            "translationZh": "是晨练呀。也有人在跳交际舞吧？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：朝の運動ですよ。社交ダンスをしている人たちもいたでしょう？",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-002-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.62,
              "duration": 4.62,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-005",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "ええ、いました。ほかに、踊りながら歌を歌っている人もいましたよ。",
            "translationZh": "是的，有。此外，还有人边跳舞边唱歌。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：ええ、いました。ほかに、踊りながら歌を歌っている人もいましたよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-002-line-005",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-002-line-005.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.43,
              "duration": 4.43,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l27-app-block-003",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "（聊起公园收费的问题）",
        "translationZh": "（聊起公园收费的问题）",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（聊起公园收费的问题）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l27-app-block-004",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-004-line-001",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "公園に入る時、入園料を払いましたが、どの公園も有料ですか。",
            "translationZh": "进公园时我付了入园费，不过所有公园都收费吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：公園に入る時、入園料を払いましたが、どの公園も有料ですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-004-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-004-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 0.26,
              "duration": 0.26,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-004-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ええ。有料の公園が多いですね。",
            "translationZh": "是的，收费的公园很多。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ええ。有料の公園が多いですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-004-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-004-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 0.38,
              "duration": 0.38,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-004-line-003",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "じゃあ、朝の運動をしているお年寄りたちも入園料を払うんですか。",
            "translationZh": "那么，那些晨练的老人也要付入园费吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：じゃあ、朝の運動をしているお年寄りたちも入園料を払うんですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-004-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-004-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 0.38,
              "duration": 0.38,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-004-line-004",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "そうですよ。でも、毎日利用する人は割引があるんです。",
            "translationZh": "是的。不过每天使用的人有优惠。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：そうですよ。でも、毎日利用する人は割引があるんです。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l27-app-block-004-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson27/l27-app-block-004-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 0.26,
              "duration": 0.26,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:05:13.094Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "c5fd1fe3d49a4e6843709de64118a3398d5c4860260476bde325405c4b141f84"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l27-app-block-005",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "（小戴想起孩提时代的事）",
        "translationZh": "（小戴想起孩提时代的事）",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（小戴想起孩提时代的事）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l27-app-block-006",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l27-app-block-006-line-001",
            "speaker": "戴",
            "text": "そう言えば、小さい時、よく祖母といっしょに公園へ行きました。",
